    {
      "local_id": "cl-1",
      "text": "本章以「五百年后……」作为时间标记，叙述在取经队伍失散的情境之后跳跃五百年。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 34,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000034.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000034",
          "chapter_order": 34,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "五百年后……"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "cl-2",
      "text": "一个白色身影在黑夜中轻盈掠过，本场景地点标注为「人界　万灵之森」。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 34,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000034.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000034",
          "chapter_order": 34,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "万灵之森"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "cl-3",
      "text": "猪八戒见到归来的小白龙，称她「死小白」，问她是不是回娘家了、去了这么久，并说自己为了等她已拒绝几百个美丽姑娘的邀请。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0003/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0003"
      },
      "revealed_at": 34,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000034.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000034",
          "chapter_order": 34,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "死小白，你回娘家了？去这么久？"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "cl-4",
      "text": "猪八戒说唐僧（被其称作「秃头」）的肉身昨天还有两条腿在这里，此刻却不知去哪儿了。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0003/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0003"
      },
      "revealed_at": 34,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000034.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000034",
          "chapter_order": 34,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "昨天还有两条腿在这儿的"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "cl-5",
      "text": "小白龙直接询问「师父的……身体呢？」，并在猪八戒答不上来后斥责他「你怎么能这样」。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 34,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000034.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000034",
          "chapter_order": 34,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "师父的……身体呢？"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "cl-6",
      "text": "小白龙自述她日夜赶路、一刻也不肯歇，只为能赶回来。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0017/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0017"
      },
      "revealed_at": 34,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000034.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000034",
          "chapter_order": 34,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我……我日夜赶路，一刻也不肯歇"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "cl-7",
      "text": "猪八戒对小白龙说，她就算是千里马也追不上「他的魂」，并说人死了以后没活着时好看——即以唐僧已死为前提说话。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0003/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0003"
      },
      "revealed_at": 34,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000034.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000034",
          "chapter_order": 34,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "也追不上他的魂"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "cl-8",
      "text": "小白龙说她不相信唐僧就这么死了、认为他一定还能活过来，并指出孙悟空已经去找他的魂。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0017/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0017"
      },
      "revealed_at": 34,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000034.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000034",
          "chapter_order": 34,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "孙悟空不是已经去找他的魂了吗"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "cl-9",
      "text": "猪八戒认为孙悟空若能回来早就回来了，猜测他是在哪儿遇上一只母猴过幸福生活去了。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0003/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0003"
      },
      "revealed_at": 34,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000034.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000034",
          "chapter_order": 34,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "能回来的话，他早也回来了"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "cl-10",
      "text": "小白龙自称她是因为不肯嫁上天庭才被罚做白马，并非自己想做马。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0017/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0017"
      },
      "revealed_at": 34,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000034.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000034",
          "chapter_order": 34,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "因为不肯嫁上天庭才被罚做白马"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "cl-11",
      "text": "猪八戒说小白龙变成马的样子，他老是忘了她的性别，并称「不该在女孩子面前说粗口」。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0003/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0003"
      },
      "revealed_at": 34,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000034.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000034",
          "chapter_order": 34,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我老是忘了你性别"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "cl-12",
      "text": "小白龙以「老娘」自称，双方对话把她当作女孩子看待。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0017/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0017"
      },
      "revealed_at": 34,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000034.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000034",
          "chapter_order": 34,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "别和老娘来这套"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "cl-13",
      "text": "猪八戒叹了一口气，上前拍拍小白龙的背。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 34,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000034.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000034",
          "chapter_order": 34,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "上去拍拍小白龙的背"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "cl-14",
      "text": "猪八戒对小白龙说他们都走了，现在只剩下他们俩「孤魂野鬼」，要她保重。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0003/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0003"
      },
      "revealed_at": 34,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000034.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000034",
          "chapter_order": 34,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "现在只剩下我们俩孤魂野鬼了"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "cl-15",
      "text": "小白龙先前大哭，随后又带着眼泪大笑起来；猪八戒自己也笑了。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
